title: 装甲巡洋舰 A
subtitle: 一个政治问题
tags: event, govt_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_seen = 1
view-if: panzerkreuzer_seen = 0 and year = 1928 and month >= 8 and reichswehr_minister_party != "SPD" and spd_in_government = 1
new-page: true

= Panzerkreuzer

The Reichswehr Ministry is demanding the construction of a new battlecruiser, as part of Germany's rearmament. Our coalition partners are united in support. While many of our members are vehemently against new military spending, this vote may be necessary to preserve the coalition. 
我们当初是以「给孩子面包,而不是战列巡洋舰」为口号竞选的。我们真的背弃竞选承诺吗?

- @vote_yes: 投赞成票,建造这艘战列巡洋舰。
- @vote_no: 投反对票,反对建造这艘战列巡洋舰。
- @abstain: 弃权。

@vote_yes
on-arrival: bill_support = bourgeois_coalition+far_right_coalition; bill_support += spd_r*(0.75-dissent); bill_support = 100*(bill_support/(100-(spd_r*dissent))); left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; kpd_relation -= 6; workers_spd -= 3; socialism -= 3; {!
Q.bill_support = Math.round(Q.bill_support);
!}

Our grassroots party members are shocked by our intransigence! Many party branches have begun agitating against the cabinet, and our Reichstag members even plan a full vote on the proposal, contravening the government's decision.

共产党:反对

[? if sapd_formed : SAPD: 反对 ?]

社民党:意见不一

[+ ddp_name +]: For

Z: For

巴伐利亚人民党:赞成

人民党:赞成

其他:赞成

国家人民党:赞成

纳粹党:赞成

以 [+ bill_support +]% 赞成,议案获得通过。

反对战列巡洋舰的运动失败了,只有持异议的社民党与共产党议员投了反对票。这艘军舰将被建造。

@vote_no
on-arrival: dvp_relation -= 8; z_relation -= 5; pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1
go-to: vote_no_chancellor if chancellor_party = "SPD"; vote_no_pass if chancellor_party != "SPD" and left_coalition < 50; vote_no_success if left_coalition >= 50

@vote_no_chancellor
go-to: braun if chancellor = "Braun"; muller if chancellor = "Müller"

@braun
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 0; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent); panzerkreuzer_failed = 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent); coup_progress += 1

我们执政伙伴对我们的强硬态度感到震惊!不过,布劳恩总理成功说服了我们的内阁部长们,放弃就战列巡洋舰进行表决的计划。 The ship will not be built!

@muller
go-to: muller_passed if left_coalition < 50; muller_beaten if left_coalition >= 50

@muller_beaten
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 0; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent); panzerkreuzer_failed = 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent); coup_progress += 1; bill_support = bourgeois_coalition+far_right_coalition

Our coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Despite Chancellor Müller's rejection of the proposal, the other parties bring the matter to a Reichstag vote, which too fails, even with only the SPD and KPD voting against. The ship will not be built!

共产党:反对

